ession is its one word.\n\nI'll output just \"yes\". Lowercase, no period — \"exactly the word yes.\" A period would arguably not be \"exactly the word yes.\" So just:\n\nyes"},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":145,"completion_tokens":431,"total_tokens":576,"cached_tokens":145,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":415},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":145}}}